{"text": "Morning! Sleep okay?", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hey Brokk, good to see you back at the forge.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Welcome to the mine, stranger.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hey everyone, good morning!", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Ingrid! There you are.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Good to see you all made it back from the gate alive.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Hi.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Look who decided to show up at the tavern.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "See you at supper.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take care out there, Steinar.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Goodnight, everyone.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Safe travels back to the mine.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'm heading home. Later.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Bye.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Off to the farm, don't wait up.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Catch you later, Dagna.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sky's clear today, might actually get some sun for once.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could eat a whole loaf of bread right now.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "This ale's stronger than usual.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Feels like it's been raining for a week straight.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could murder a plate of stew right now.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Quiet shift today.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "The old cart wheel still squeaks on the way to the farm.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Funny how the forge is always the warmest place in winter.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Hrolf's been humming that same tune all day.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Hrolf"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Skadi's been down at the mine every day this week.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Skadi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Frida's bread came out a little burnt again, but nobody's complaining.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tova found a couple of small nuggets in the scrap pile again.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Tova"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Have you seen my pickaxe anywhere?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "How much for the ore, Sindri?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "What's for dinner tonight?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Is the gate locked yet?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Who's on watch tonight?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You hear that noise outside?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Why's Eitri letting the forge go cold again?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Did the goblin trader come by today?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Are we really out of ale already?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "What's taking Frida so long at the mine?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Is Yngvar ever going to finish that axe?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could you pass the bread, Gudrun?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Can you grab another round of ale?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Would you mind sharpening this axe for me?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Mind helping me haul this ore up?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could someone count the gold before we lock the vault?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Please tell Vidar I'll be late.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Can I get a refill, Torvi?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Give me a hand with this cart, would you?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Spare a moment to look over my trade goods?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could everyone pitch in watering the crops today?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Move.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Everyone to the gate, now!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Get that fire going, Eitri.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Drop the pickaxe and step back.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Lock the gate behind you, Dvalin.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take the wounded to the great hall.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sound the alarm.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Get down!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 1.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Stack the ore by the forge before nightfall.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Keep the kids away from the mine entrance.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll trade you two loaves for that dagger, Brynja.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Brynja"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Want a pull of my ale?", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I can fix that axe for you, no charge.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take my spot by the fire.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll walk you back to the great hall.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Here, have the last of the bread, Ingrid.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Ingrid"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'll cover your shift at the mine tomorrow.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Drinks are on me tonight, everyone.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Thanks.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Nice work on that axe, Dvalin.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "This bread is amazing, Frida.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Best batch of ale we've had all year.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Dagna really outdid herself at the forge today.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Solid haul today, Kolbrun.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Not bad at all, considering how the day started.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Brynja's got the steadiest hands in the clan.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Brynja"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Runa had some quick thinking back there.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry, Runa.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My bad, I broke your pickaxe.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry I'm late for the shift.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I shouldn't have snapped at you earlier, Halvar.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry about your crops, the goats got loose again.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I really shouldn't have said that.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Didn't mean to spill your ale.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Nice swing, genius.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "You couldn't swing an axe if your life depended on it.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Real impressive, Orm, you burned the bread again.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "You call that mining?", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Steinar couldn't hit a barn door with that axe.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Some guard Torvi turned out to be.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Borin's about as sharp as a butter knife.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Vidar couldn't find his own boots most mornings.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Wow, didn't burn the whole forge down this time.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "It would be a shame if your forge caught fire.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Touch my ale again and see what happens.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, or you'll end up in the lava.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Cross me again, Sindri, and you'll regret it.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.7, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "One more word and you're out the gate.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "If Borin touches my treasure chest again, he'll regret it.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "If Halvar tries that again, he won't like what happens.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Next person who touches my ale is getting thrown out.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, the lava is close.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Creeper!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 1.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Watch your step, the mine shaft's unstable there.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "There's a zombie by the farm gate.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.8, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Spiders in the lower tunnel, don't go alone.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The forge fire's getting too high, back away, Eitri.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.7, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Someone warn Steinar the bridge is rotten before he crosses it.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.6, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Ragna the goblin trader's been casing the storehouse.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Watch out, there's ice on the steps.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Someone should tell Vidar about the spiders before he heads down.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.6, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Where did my ore go, Brokk?", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That's my pickaxe you're holding, Yngvar.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Yngvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You let the fire go out on purpose, didn't you, Gudrun?", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't trust Sindri, he cheats at dice.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Ragna's the one who left the gate open, not me.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Halvar ate the last of the stew and blamed the dog.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Orm knew the goblin trader was cheating us and said nothing.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Someone's been skimming gold from the till, and I've got a guess who.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Kolbrun's the one who left the forge unattended, not me.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
